{"id":"u80","kelas":"ielts","no":5,"judul":"Kosakata Akademik I: Pendidikan dan Teknologi","title":"Academic Vocabulary I","emoji":"🏫","ringkas":"Kata akademik yang sering muncul dan cara memakainya","ready":true,"goals":["mempelajari kosakata akademik tentang **pendidikan dan teknologi**","memahami arti dan **contoh pemakaian** tiap kata","mengenali **bentuk kata** dan kolokasi","mengulang kata lewat berbagai jenis latihan"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Kosakata akademik membantu di semua bagian IELTS: Reading, Listening, Writing, dan Speaking. Unit ini membahas topik **Pendidikan dan Teknologi**. Setiap kata disertai arti dan contoh kalimat. Pelajari **bentuk kata** (benda, kerja, sifat) dan **kata yang sering menyertainya** (kolokasi), bukan hanya arti."},{"t":"grammar","table":[["Langkah","Contoh"],["Pelajari bentuk kata","[[educate → education → educational]]"],["Pelajari kolokasi","[[raise awareness]], [[reduce pollution]], [[conduct research]]"],["Pakai dalam kalimat sendiri","[[Pollution threatens marine life.]]"],["Ulangi setelah 1, 3, dan 7 hari","kartu kosakata atau catatan"]],"text":"Menghafal arti saja tidak cukup untuk Writing dan Speaking. Pakailah kata baru dalam kalimat dan ulangi secara berkala.","title":"1. Cara belajar kosakata akademik"},{"items":[{"en":"curriculum (n)","ex":"The school is changing its curriculum to include coding.","id":"kurikulum"},{"en":"tuition (n)","ex":"Tuition at private universities is often expensive.","id":"uang kuliah"},{"en":"scholarship (n)","ex":"She won a scholarship to study in Australia.","id":"beasiswa"},{"en":"graduate (v)","ex":"He will graduate from university next year.","id":"lulus, tamat"},{"en":"lecture (n)","ex":"The lecture on biology lasted two hours.","id":"kuliah (ceramah di kelas)"},{"en":"assignment (n)","ex":"Our assignment is due on Friday.","id":"tugas"},{"en":"research (n)","ex":"Her research focuses on language learning.","id":"penelitian"},{"en":"degree (n)","ex":"He has a degree in engineering.","id":"gelar sarjana"},{"en":"qualification (n)","ex":"A teaching qualification is required for this job.","id":"kualifikasi"},{"en":"literacy (n)","ex":"The government wants to improve adult literacy.","id":"kemampuan baca tulis"},{"en":"enrol (v)","ex":"Students must enrol before the term starts.","id":"mendaftar"},{"en":"attend (v)","ex":"Children must attend school until the age of sixteen.","id":"menghadiri"}],"t":"vocab","title":"2. Kata-kata Pendidikan (1)"},{"items":[{"en":"assess (v)","ex":"Teachers assess students with tests and projects.","id":"menilai"},{"en":"compulsory (adj)","ex":"Education is compulsory for all children.","id":"wajib"},{"en":"vocational (adj)","ex":"Vocational training prepares people for specific jobs.","id":"kejuruan"},{"en":"institution (n)","ex":"The institution offers courses in many subjects.","id":"lembaga"},{"en":"innovation (n)","ex":"Innovation drives progress in technology.","id":"inovasi"},{"en":"device (n)","ex":"Most students own a mobile device.","id":"perangkat"},{"en":"digital (adj)","ex":"Digital skills are important in modern jobs.","id":"digital"},{"en":"software (n)","ex":"The software helps teachers mark tests quickly.","id":"perangkat lunak"},{"en":"access (n)","ex":"Access to the internet is limited in some villages.","id":"akses"},{"en":"automate (v)","ex":"Factories automate many tasks to save time.","id":"mengotomatisasi"},{"en":"platform (n)","ex":"The online platform connects students and tutors.","id":"platform"},{"en":"virtual (adj)","ex":"Virtual classrooms allow students to learn from home.","id":"maya, virtual"}],"t":"vocab","title":"3. Kata-kata Pendidikan dan Teknologi (2)"},{"items":[{"en":"network (n)","ex":"The school network was down this morning.","id":"jaringan"},{"en":"upgrade (v)","ex":"The library plans to upgrade its computers.","id":"meningkatkan, memperbarui"},{"en":"efficient (adj)","ex":"Online forms are more efficient than paper ones.","id":"efisien"},{"en":"obsolete (adj)","e